<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Password Reset Successful</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f0f2f5;
        color: #2d2d2d;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 40px 0;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #17a34a 0%, #0d8f3f 100%);
        padding: 40px 30px 60px;
        text-align: center;
        position: relative;
      }
      .icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 64px;
        height: 64px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #17a34a;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: bold;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 22px;
        margin: 16px 0 0;
        font-weight: 600;
      }
      .body-content {
        padding: 40px 32px 30px;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .body-content p {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #4a4a4a;
        margin: 12px 0;
      }
      .body-content .name {
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #17a34a;
      }
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #e6f7ec;
        color: #17a34a;
        font-size: 13px;
        font-weight: 600;
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        margin: 10px 0 18px;
        letter-spacing: 0.3px;
      }
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: #eee;
        margin: 24px 0;
      }
      .warning {
        background: #fff8e6;
        border-left: 3px solid #f5b400;
        padding: 12px 16px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #7a5c00;
        text-align: left;
        margin-top: 10px;
      }
      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 24px 20px 30px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #999;
      }
      .footer strong {
        color: #666;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
          <div class="icon">&#10003;</div>
          <h1>Password Reset Successful</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="body-content">
          <span class="badge">Account Secured</span>
          <p>Hello <span class="name"><%= name %></span>,</p>
          <p>Your password has been changed successfully. You can now log in to your <strong>PH Healthcare System</strong> account using your new password.</p>

          <div class="divider"></div>

          <div class="warning">
            If you did not make this change, please contact support immediately to secure your account.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
          &copy; <strong>PH Healthcare System</strong>. All rights reserved.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html> 